        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "Implemented `count_powerful_integers` with digit-DP prefix counting, including handling for suffixes with leading zeros.\n\n**Publication is blocked by one inconsistent test.** The supplied test expects 733 for `(9251, 82480, 9, \"49\")`, but the integers in that range ending in `49` run from `9349` through `82449` in steps of 100—**732 integers**. The implementation returns 732, consistent with the specification. The other supplied cases pass.\n\nI attempted publication, but the component tests failed on that assertion, so no release was published. Updating the expected value to 732 would allow publication to be retried.",
